id=MTK_D8100_Vulkan1.4.Panvk
name=Dimensity 8100 PanVK WSI7 (Vulkan only)
version=1.0.0-wsi7
versionCode=10
author=wxcvm; upstream zenithblue-oss
description=PanVK WSI7 stable release (Mesa 26.3 + 019-034 patches) for PGKM10/Android 17. Fixes the Mali GPU_SHAREABILITY_FAULT (GPU-uncached imports) that killed SystemUI under HWUI Vulkan, and the one-shot Android acquire replay that fixed WeChat official-account freezes. Default OFF; enable with the Action button. OpenGL/EGL and SurfaceFlinger RenderEngine stay on the OEM GL path.
